{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":34938611,"ns":0,"title":"Andreotti–Vesentini theorem","extract":"In mathematics, the Andreotti–Vesentini separation theorem, introduced by Aldo Andreotti and Edoardo Vesentini (1965, 1965b) states that certain cohomology groups of coherent sheaves are separated.","description":"Certain cohomology groups of coherent sheaves are separated","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}